  "short_description": "<p>Eco-friendly bamboo hanging lampshade handcrafted in Vietnam. Ideal for home or commercial interiors, available for wholesale and custom production.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"636\">Elevate your interior space with this stunning <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"410\">bamboo hanging lampshade</strong>, handwoven by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Made from sustainably sourced bamboo, each piece offers a harmonious blend of <strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"580\">natural texture, warmth, and light diffusion</strong>, ideal for modern, rustic, boho, or tropical interiors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"890\">Perfect for living rooms, cafés, restaurants, resorts, and boutique hotels, our bamboo pendant lights bring an organic touch while reducing plastic and synthetic use. The open-weave design casts beautiful shadows, creating a cozy and inviting ambiance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1078\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"931\">manufacturer in Vietnam</strong>, we offer <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"964\">OEM/ODM production</strong> for custom shapes, sizes, weaving patterns, and electrical fittings to suit your brand or project specifications.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1107\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1107\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<li data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1149\">\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1149\"><strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1149\">Handwoven from 100% natural bamboo</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1192\">\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1192\">Lightweight, durable, and eco-friendly</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1255\">\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1255\">Compatible with E27 bulb fittings (optional customization)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1321\">\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1321\">Available in various shapes: round, bell, dome, drum, cone&#8230;</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1382\">\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1382\">Suitable for home décor, hospitality, or retail lighting</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<p data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1447\">Custom sizes, colors, and branding available for bulk orders</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1496\">\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1496\">Made by artisan communities in rural Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1547\">Packed flat or assembled for shipping efficiency</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1552\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1586\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1586\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1753\">We welcome international bulk orders, retailer partnerships, and hotel/resort procurement.<br data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1681\" />📧 Email: <strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1718\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1716\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1721\" />🌐 Website: <strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1753\"><a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1751\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></strong></p>",
